Brand marks in this folder come from Simple Icons, version 16.38.1.
Source: https://github.com/simple-icons/simple-icons (npm package "simple-icons").
Simple Icons is released under CC0 1.0 Universal. Only the 43 icons this mock uses are copied here,
unchanged; ../brands.js holds the same paths as data.

The marks are trademarks of their owners. Simple Icons' data lists a license for some icons; icons with
a license other than CC0 (here: Rust, CC-BY-SA-4.0, and Lobsters, BSD-3-Clause) were left out and those
sites keep their Phosphor icon. None of the icons used is marked as not to be used.

